/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4420660,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1846018067927665","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"update","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #4 (v0.1.7)","summary":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #4 (v0.1.7)Hey everyone,Thank you for all the reports and clips about stutters and freezes - this update is built from them. Hotfix #5 is all about optimization: the game should run smoother, especially in co-op and while using voice chat.Smoother gameplay- Fixed small stutters that some of you had about once every second.- Fixed co-op sessions where players would stop seeing each other for a while. If you still see this, please let us know.- The game now does less wo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T22:11:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1845383656392209","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"update","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #3 (v0.1.6)","summary":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #3 (v0.1.6) Hey everyone,Thank you for all the reports, logs and clips - this update is built almost entirely from them. The biggest fixes: players getting stuck on the ground after a knockdown (especially after the Grow gun), monsters running at about half their intended speed, and the blue screen on Intel graphics. Graphics- Intel graphics (Iris Xe, UHD and similar): turned off a rendering feature that did not work correctly on these GPUs. The game should now start ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T23:06:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392209","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1845383656391080","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"update","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #2.2 (v0.1.5)","summary":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #2.2 (v0.1.5)Hey everyone,Quick fix for the blue screen some of you saw: the level was not drawn at all (you could only see items and monsters), mostly on PCs where the Low graphics preset gets picked automatically. Thank you for the screenshots! - Fixed the blue screen / invisible level on all graphics presets.- Fixed black edges around the lobby mirror at a render scale below 100%. If you had the blue screen, just update and restart the game.The ZONE L.O.S.T. team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T11:26:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1845383656390149","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"update","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #2.1 (v0.1.3)","summary":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #2.1 (v0.1.3)A quick follow-up to Hotfix #2 with two co-op fixes. Multiplayer- Fixed doors snapping back when a client let go of them: a door you pull open as a client now stays where you left it for everyone.- Fixed mousetraps not triggering correctly in co-op. The ZONE L.O.S.T. team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T22:58:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1845383656390080","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"update","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #2 (v0.1.2)","summary":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #2 (v0.1.2)Hey everyone,Thank you for playing the demo, for streaming it and for every bug report. This round is about performance, Level 1 and the monsters: you told us the game could run smoother and that the monsters had swung too far the other way after Hotfix #1. We also fixed a number of things you found in co-op. Details below. Performance- New graphics presets in Options > Graphics: Low / Medium / High / Custom. The default is picked by your video memory.- Low","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T22:20:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1845383656387665","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"update","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #1 (v0.1.1)","summary":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - Hotfix #1 (v0.1.1)Hey everyone,Thank you for playing the demo and for every single bug report. This is our first big round of fixes and balance changes, based directly on what you sent us through the in-game form and on Discord. Monsters were too strong, co-op had rough edges, and falling over felt bad. All of that is addressed below. MonstersWe heard you: the monsters were too strong and seemed to always know where you were. We have reworked how they spot, hear and chase yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T20:42:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656387665","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4420660-1845383656381821","game_id":"steam-4420660","kind":"announcement","title":"ZONE L.O.S.T. Demo - OUT NOW!!!","summary":"You can now download and play the official ZONE L.O.S.T. demo on Steam! Grab up to 3 friends, jump into the Zone, and try to survive (or watch each other fail miserably). Play the Demo on Steam:","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T15:24:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656381821","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4420660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4420660":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4420660":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5300910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4420660","app_id":4420660,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c58416788562c03f61d9840766e6cfdb3d80d579c26c526dc8168913029b61d5","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"YOUR BODY IS YOUR WEAKNESS. A four-player co-op horror game that puts you in the shoes of the chief scientists of a research facility. Your sole objective is to carry out the self-destruct plan and escape the facility.","publishers":[{"name":"DAKA Production"}],"developers":[{"name":"DAKA Production"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1793876160,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"ZONE L.O.S.T. — Announcement Trailer","trailer_url_format":"s